  "metadata": {
    "status": "draft",
    "notes": "Read-only except for running a spec's checks. Approving a spec stays a command-line action until roles are enforced; assigning a role comes with the role model (FB-075), and the users-and-roles objects follow docs/decisions/roles.md. What the hub serves for each object today: components and modules from its health and registry; governed files and schema versions from the governance commands (no served route yet); users, roles and assignments from nothing until FB-075."
